/extras/1fbabfda481e572b07cd5945c709229f.mp4?t=1743563581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Many Components</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7With more than 200 components (more to be added in the future), the backpack space is maximized through careful placement, and the combat power is quickly increased through effect matching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can also battle against other players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Try to survive longer than your opponent under tremendous waves of alien invaders to see who can <strong>Make County Great Again!!!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-----------------------------</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you encounter a Bug in the game, if it is convenient for you, please find the &quot;Player.log&quot; in the root directory of the game, which is a shortcut, open and copy all the text content to us, if you can also add a little text description and pictures of the Bug is better, we will try to repair, thank you for your support!</p>","developers":["BoldBoltStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418970/214f85cea2ff9033eedf6cb42272776d7bc5fb55/header.jpg?t=1743563581","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3418970/834115/6cb0dd2f28c9554155e196af7f7c41c467f9f54b/1750849097/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743409974","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3418970/834115/6cb0dd2f28c9554155e196af7f7c41c467f9f54b/1750849097/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743409974","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3418970/834115/6cb0